    "physicalDescription": "Psychadelic poster in green, dark red, orange, and purple, with a white outer border, black background with purple green and orange line bordered frame with dark red swirl decoration in a top panel continuing in a repeating cusped border round the image. The main image set against a green background, features a topless woman with dark skin, green eyes and orange cheeks, and long orange hair adorned with a jewelled hair band. She wears an ankle lenth purple skirt with geometric decorations in green, orange and purple around the hem and is smoking a hookah piple. The text is in green and forms part of the image towards the top, surrounded by stylized floral decoration.",
